  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2070301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Edith",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207030301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207030301": {
            "id": "207030301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you need, specifically?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030303"
            ]
          },
          "207030303": {
            "id": "207030303",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "You can see the elements, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030304"
            ]
          },
          "207030304": {
            "id": "207030304",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I reckon that you just need to follow the trail of Anemo and search that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030305"
            ]
          },
          "207030305": {
            "id": "207030305",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I'll be waiting for you under the tree. If you find anything, just bring it down to me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070304",
      "subQuestName": "Search in the tree for 3 traces of the wind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207030401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207030401": {
            "id": "207030401",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I have to say that someone like you is definitely better suited to doing research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030402"
            ]
          },
          "207030402": {
            "id": "207030402",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "You have a great deal of adventuring experience, and great stamina...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030403"
            ]
          },
          "207030403": {
            "id": "207030403",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "And most importantly, you can control the elements even without the use of a Vision.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030404"
            ]
          },
          "207030404": {
            "id": "207030404",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "The elements... Is there really any research on this continent that could uncover their secrets? To a researcher, the ability to use a Vision or the lack thereof really is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030405"
            ]
          },
          "207030405": {
            "id": "207030405",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Ah, I went off on a tangent again... Sorry, please don't take it to heart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070305",
      "subQuestName": "Search in the tree for 3 traces of the wind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207030501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207030501": {
            "id": "207030501",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Have you found anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030502"
            ]
          },
          "207030502": {
            "id": "207030502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Got a few leaves here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030503"
            ]
          },
          "207030503": {
            "id": "207030503",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "...Leaves? Let me have a look, please. Huh, you even put them inside a box...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030504"
            ]
          },
          "207030504": {
            "id": "207030504",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "When held in your hand, these leaves do indeed allow you to feel the Anemo within them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030505"
            ]
          },
          "207030505": {
            "id": "207030505",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "To think that this tree really had this power. If I only had a Vision, then I wouldn't have had to waste this much time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030506"
            ]
          },
          "207030506": {
            "id": "207030506",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Thank you. This is a very precious resource, and I will use it as such.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030507"
            ]
          },
          "207030507": {
            "id": "207030507",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Still, I don't have any method of preserving these leaves. It is fully possible that the Anemo in them could dissipate all too quickly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030508"
            ]
          },
          "207030508": {
            "id": "207030508",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Still, take this as recompense for your efforts. Who knows, I might need to call on you in the future to help me collect research material."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070302",
      "subQuestName": "Search in the tree for 3 traces of the wind",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207030201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207030201": {
            "id": "207030201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll do it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030202"
            ]
          },
          "207030202": {
            "id": "207030202",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Great, I'm counting on you, then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070303",
      "subQuestName": "Give the leaves to Edith",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070301",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207030101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207030101": {
            "id": "207030101",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "What a shame, I can't use this material either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030102"
            ]
          },
          "207030102": {
            "id": "207030102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you working on?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030103"
            ]
          },
          "207030103": {
            "id": "207030103",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I mean to write a new book about Mondstadt's history that focuses on Anemo, and I'm looking for inspiration here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030104"
            ]
          },
          "207030104": {
            "id": "207030104",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "If you think about it, this place is the ideal spot — there's a Statue of The Seven that represents Anemo, and a tree that's closely linked to the legend of the great hero Vennessa.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030105"
            ]
          },
          "207030105": {
            "id": "207030105",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Yet — and I know this might sound funny — looking for and gathering Anemo without a Vision, which I lack, is too difficult.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030106"
            ]
          },
          "207030106": {
            "id": "207030106",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "And this so-called search for inspiration? Why, I'm just staring into space here. Most of my material is synthesized from second-hand resources as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030107"
            ]
          },
          "207030107": {
            "id": "207030107",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "That's the life of a person without a Vision on this continent — to do much, and yet achieve little.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030108"
            ]
          },
          "207030108": {
            "id": "207030108",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "One cannot use the power of the elements without a Vision. Whether in research or in life, those without them live like outsiders in their own world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030109"
            ]
          },
          "207030109": {
            "id": "207030109",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Hahaha, maybe in the eyes of the gods, Vision wielders are the main characters of this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030110"
            ]
          },
          "207030110": {
            "id": "207030110",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Sorry, I said too much, and while I did say all this, I won't give up on my research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030111"
            ]
          },
          "207030111": {
            "id": "207030111",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I don't have a Vision, but I won't lose in terms of scholarship.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030112"
            ]
          },
          "207030112": {
            "id": "207030112",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "I've also heard that you can use the elements even without a Vision...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030113"
            ]
          },
          "207030113": {
            "id": "207030113",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "If you could help me to grab some objects imbued with Anemo, that would really help me with my research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207030114"
            ]
          },
          "207030114": {
            "id": "207030114",
            "speakerId": 1555,
            "speakerName": "Dr. Edith",
            "text": "Could you help me climb up this tree and have a look?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}